# Corpus boundary for graphify. This repo is checked out at ~/dev/dotfiles, so
# the scan root is the checkout, not $HOME.
#
# .gitignore alone is not enough here. Of the 81 files the rule below excludes,
# only 11 are gitignored as well; the other 70 are tracked but not gitignored
# (.powerline/, .cmux/, .warp/, .cargo/env, dev/_GETDITTO/CLAUDE.md, the
# Library/ application configs), and graphify reads .gitignore, so those would
# stay in the corpus.
#
# `/*/` matches root-level DIRECTORIES only, so root-level files stay in the
# corpus (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, README.md, ...). Files that are root-level but
# of a type graphify does not index -- justfile, hk.pkl, .zshrc, Brewfile --
# are dropped for that reason, not by this rule. Git's parent-exclusion rule
# means a `!` line below cannot re-include anything beneath a directory
# excluded here, so Library/LaunchAgents/*.plist is deliberately out of scope.
/*/
!/.agents/
!/.claude/
!/.codex/
!/.config/
!/.gemini/
!/.github/
!/.omp/
!/.opencode/
!/.pi/
!/bin/
!/crates/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/settings/
!/tests/
